y":"Seafood","historical_business_count":2}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Cajun/Creole, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"pym7c6ZFEtmoH16xN2ApBg","review_id":"4Lu0W9L387cO24EtZJ5lbw","date":"2011-10-10T18:51:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9497069120407104,"text_excerpt":"Katie's in Mid City is a gem! I strolled in on a whim this weekend and am sure glad I did. I don't know why I've never been in before - I've heard many good things about it and it's very close to where I live. This review is going to cover two recent visits. The first I walked in alone on a Saturday afternoon and sat at the bar with a friendly bartender. He made sure my drinks stay filled and apologized multiple times about the wait on my pizza (a 20-top had just sat down and ordered relatively around the same time, so timing was forgiven.) I ordered the Boudreaux a delicious outside the ordinary pizza with a crispy homemade crust, house cochon de lait, roasted garlic, fresh spinach, red ..."},{"business_id":"pym7c6ZFEtmoH16xN2ApBg","review_id":"2vtLIAv1PSIMIgOOkpAuKg","date":"2019-01-24T17:46:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.945844292640686,"text_excerpt":"I've been to Katie's numerous times, but I've stayed away in recent years due to the super long wait times and inability to make reservations. A few weeks ago, a good friend was in town and we chose Katie's for Sunday brunch. The wait was about 45 minutes for a table and first come, first serve seating at the bar, so we decided to wait it out. After we were seated (and it really was about 45 minutes), we ordered a round of sangrias, the crawfish beignet appetizer, chargrilled oysters and split a soft shell crab poboy with sweet potato fries. Side note: the soft shell crab poboy is normally available for dinner and not brunch/lunch, but we checked with our waitress and it wasn't an issue. ..."},{"business_id":"pym7c6ZFEtmoH16xN2ApBg","review_id":"64YTJIGXDwc-6NdABEDVIg","date":"2015-07-18T18:16:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9448062181472778,"text_excerpt":"The first time I came here was for a birthday dinner and it's become a favorite ever since. I love getting Jenny's garlic feta fries because the fries are perfectly crispy and buttery. I also love the feta cheese on the fries, and who doesn't love a dish named after a girl named Jenny?! Hehe. There was some leftover feta cheese that I saved to put on the pizza we ordered. . . A little ghetto but whatever! I love my feta! The chargrilled oysters are also a must-have! Not too oily, greasy, or cheesy; the flavor is just perfect! This may be the best chargrilled oysters I've had compared to other places I've been (Dragos, parrains). I think I also ate the atchafalaya pizza? I remember it bein..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"pym7c6ZFEtmoH16xN2ApBg","photo_id":"vpxLqEM53qXS3sotbydigw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/vpxLqEM53qXS3sotbydigw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8859890103340149},{"business_id":"pym7c6ZFEtmoH16xN2ApBg","photo_id":"mFOrajUtBVUwmWEj4D2g4Q","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/mFOrajUtBVUwmWEj4D2g4Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8660284280776978},{"business_id":"pym7c6ZFEtmoH16xN2ApBg","photo_id":"bkCqlzRpZiVlpih1hp-UXQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/bkCqlzRpZiVlpih1hp-UXQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8622028231620789},{"business_id":"pym7c6ZFEtmoH16xN2ApBg","photo_id":"xJs87LO1Y7wVtThxGDK2MQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/xJs87LO1Y7wVtThxGDK2MQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.808762788772583},{"business_id":"pym7c6ZFEtmoH16xN2ApBg","photo_id":"RWXMXZW6Qng-FysSojTxbA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/RWXMXZW6Qng-FysSojTxbA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7834513783454895}]},"notebook_case":null}
